alana: thanks bot — I'll add a redirect and update the TOC entry to the new page. also will add a short migration note pointing Dedicated/Private customers to KMS rotation docs.

mike: can you make the PR include a changelog bullet and a short migration snippet for Dedicated? ops asked for the KMS note.

alana: yes. planning to open PR #4321 in ~2 hours with: doc edits + sample app PR + CI workflow example. tagging docs-team and eng-platform for review.

sara: :thumbsup: I'll review snippets and run the sample locally.

kevin: quick ask — add a one-liner about why ephemeral keys are better (limits blast radius + easier rotation), otherwise LGTM.

alana: good call, adding a short rationale section. quick sync in 10 if someone wants to pair on the CI step.

mike: I can join. ping me in #docs.

alana: thanks all — will post PR link and checklist once opened.
